  "schema:name": "Census 2021, G61 Occupation by hours worked by sex, Local Government Area 2021 (LGA 2021 boundaries)",
  "schema:description": "Dataset: C21_G61_LGA. Occupation by hours worked by sex data for Local Government Area 2021 (LGA 2021 boundaries), 2021 Census, Count of employed persons aged 15 years and over. This table is based on place of usual residence. Please note that there are small random adjustments made to all cell values to protect the confidentiality of data. These adjustments may cause the sum of rows or columns to differ by small amounts from table totals.",
