        "schema:PropertyValue",
        "cdi:InstanceVariable"
      ],
      "schema:name": "OCCP",
      "schema:alternateName": [
        "Occupation"
      ],
      "schema:description": "This variable describes the occupation of the main job held by employed people in the week prior to Census night. Standard output for occupation data is at the 1, 2, 3 or 4-digit level of the classification. However, in some cases Occupation (6 digit level) ([OCC06P](https://www.abs.gov.au/census/guide-census-data/census-dictionary/2021/variables-topic/income-and-work/occupation-six-digit-level-occ06p)) data may be made available.",
